      "candidate": "**Repaired scraper configuration**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"description\": \"GPU price extraction for example.test pages\",\n  \"url_patterns\": [\"https://example.test/gpu-1\", \"https://example.test/gpu-*/\"],\n  \"output_schema\": \"gpu-price-schema-v1\",\n\n  \"fields\": {\n    \"product_name\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"selectors\": [\n        { \"css\": \"h1.product-title\" },\n        { \"css\": \"div.product-info > h1\" },\n        { \"css\": \"h1.title\" }\n      ],\n      \"attr\": \"text\",\n      \"required\": true\n    },\n\n    \"price\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"selectors\": [\n        { \"css\": \"span.price, div.price\" },\n        { \"css\": \"span[data-price], div[data-price]\" },\n        { \"css\": \".price-value\", \"attr\": \"data-amount\" }\n      ],\n      \"attr\": \"text\",\n      \"regex\": \"([0-9]+[\\\\.,]?\\\\d*)\",\n      \"convert\": \"to_float\",\n      \"required\": true\n    },\n\n    \"currency\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"selectors\": [\n        { \"css\": \"span.price, div.price\" }\n      ],\n      \"attr\": \"text\",\n      \"transform\": [\n        { \"type\": \"regex_replace\", \"pattern\": \"[0-9.,\\\\s]*\", \"replacement\": \"\" },\n        { \"type\": \"trim\" }\n      ],\n      \"required\": false\n    }\n  },\n\n  \"errors\": {\n    \"product_name\": \"Missing product title\",\n    \"price\": \"Missing price\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Explanation of changes**\n\n1. **Expanded selectors** \u2013 Added multiple fallback CSS selectors for the product name and price because the page structure changed; this ensures that if the primary selector fails, alternate ones are tried.\n2. **Regex extraction for the numeric price** \u2013 Extracts only the numeric part from the price string and converts it to a float for consistency with the schema.\n3. **Currency extraction** \u2013 Uses a regex transform to strip numbers and whitespace, leaving only the currency symbol or abbreviation.\n4. **Required fields validation** \u2013 Kept `product_name` and `price` mandatory, so extraction errors are clearly reported.\n\nThese adjustments restore the expected extraction of price data and match the `gpu-price-schema-v1` format."
